    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a dark, post-apocalyptic fantasy world where chaos reigns and the underworld mages wage a brutal war for dominance. Defend the last bastions of civilization in a desperate struggle for survival. <strong>Wishlist</strong> now and <strong>DEMO</strong> coming soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478140/extras/6cc710bf1154cca1a158ca7ebd978dce.poster.avif?t=1751006734\" width=616 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478140/extras/6cc710bf1154cca1a158ca7ebd978dce.webm?t=1751006734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478140/extras/6cc710bf1154cca1a158ca7ebd978dce.mp4?t=1751006734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a variety of powerful imperial archmages, giving orders by directly interacting with structures and units as you run through your crumbling base. Fight, build, and strategize up close as waves of enemy hordes threaten your survival. Every decision is personal - every moment is a battle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478140/extras/ace031e142ca406725977608b659a35a.poster.avif?t=1751006734\" width=616 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478140/extras/ace031e142ca406725977608b659a35a.webm?t=1751006734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478140/extras/ace031e142ca406725977608b659a35a.mp4?t=1751006734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources and strike a balance between offense and defense! While mages, soldiers, and heroes are crucial to defending your strongholds, harvesting resources is just as important to support them and build new structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478140/extras/351987e1c95cbdbcb95f488d51a2b0ac.poster.avif?t=1751006734\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478140/extras/351987e1c95cbdbcb95f488d51a2b0ac.webm?t=1751006734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478140/extras/351987e1c95cbdbcb95f488d51a2b0ac.mp4?t=1751006734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level features unique, carefully handcrafted visuals from Gothic cathedrals and Persian bazaars to Asian temples, Aztec ruins, and the lost civilizations of Atlantis and beyond.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a dark, post-apocalyptic fantasy world where chaos reigns and the underworld mages wage a brutal war for dominance. Defend the last bastions of civilization in a desperate struggle for survival. <strong>Wishlist</strong> now and <strong>DEMO</strong> coming soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478140/extras/6cc710bf1154cca1a158ca7ebd978dce.poster.avif?t=1751006734\" width=616 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478140/extras/6cc710bf1154cca1a158ca7ebd978dce.webm?t=1751006734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478140/extras/6cc710bf1154cca1a158ca7ebd978dce.mp4?t=1751006734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a variety of powerful imperial archmages, giving orders by directly interacting with structures and units as you run through your crumbling base. Fight, build, and strategize up close as waves of enemy hordes threaten your survival. Every decision is personal - every moment is a battle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478140/extras/ace031e142ca406725977608b659a35a.poster.avif?t=1751006734\" width=616 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478140/extras/ace031e142ca406725977608b659a35a.webm?t=1751006734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478140/extras/ace031e142ca406725977608b659a35a.mp4?t=1751006734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources and strike a balance between offense and defense! While mages, soldiers, and heroes are crucial to defending your strongholds, harvesting resources is just as important to support them and build new structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478140/extras/351987e1c95cbdbcb95f488d51a2b0ac.poster.avif?t=1751006734\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478140/extras/351987e1c95cbdbcb95f488d51a2b0ac.webm?t=1751006734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478140/extras/351987e1c95cbdbcb95f488d51a2b0ac.mp4?t=1751006734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level features unique, carefully handcrafted visuals from Gothic cathedrals and Persian bazaars to Asian temples, Aztec ruins, and the lost civilizations of Atlantis and beyond.</p>",
    "short_description": "Defend your imperial cities against the invasion of underworld mages! Rally survivors, mages and soldiers, strengthen your defenses and fight for survival in this epic tower defense fantasy.",
